# This project builds with YARN — CI runs `yarn install --frozen-lockfile` and
# yarn.lock is the tested dependency tree. A package-lock.json produced by a
# stray `npm install` resolves a DIFFERENT tree, and the mismatch surfaces later
# as behaviour nobody can reproduce. Keep it out.
ui-desktop/package-lock.json
